sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EDGE as Edge gateway / SPC
    actor TECH as Technician
    actor LEAD as Shift leader
    participant QI as Quality Inspector
    participant OR as Orchestrator (ADK)
    participant FS as Firestore incident board
    participant TRA as Traceability
    participant PA as Process Analyst
    participant RCA as Root Cause Agent
    participant COP as Technician Copilot
    participant DOC as Incident Scribe
    participant LRN as Continuous Learning

    Note over OR,FS: Orchestrator = single entry & exit, sole writer of the board
    EDGE->>OR: {event: defect_spike, rate: 0.077, since: 09:40}
    OR->>FS: {incident: INC-0412, status: detecting}
    OR->>QI: classify defect (board snapshot)
    QI-->>OR: {type: scratch_vertical, location, severity}
    OR->>FS: record finding, status: tracing

    Note over OR,TRA: Step 1 - sequential and mandatory
    OR->>TRA: link defective products to discrete topology
    TRA-->>OR: {suspects: [CNC-02/T07 0.95], excluded: [material_lot]}
    OR->>FS: record finding

    Note over OR,PA: Step 2 - sensor telemetry analysis
    OR->>PA: pull CNC-02 sensor telemetry, 09:00-10:00
    PA-->>OR: {finding: vibration +35%, current +12%, since: 09:30, confidence: 0.8}
    OR->>FS: record finding

    Note over OR,RCA: Step 3 - root cause synthesis & RAG lookup
    OR->>RCA: synthesize all evidence (5-Whys + Ishikawa)
    Note over RCA: RCA queries RAG tool (manuals, maint logs, 8D)
    alt confidence >= 0.7
        RCA-->>OR: {root_cause: T07 worn, over tool life, confidence: 0.87, whys, ishikawa}
        OR->>FS: record root cause
    else confidence < 0.7
        RCA-->>OR: {need: close-up photo of insert}
        OR->>COP: dispatch diagnostic inspection request
        COP->>TECH: ask for close-up photo (voice + camera)
        TECH-->>COP: diagnostic photo
        COP-->>OR: diagnostic evidence
        OR->>FS: attach diagnostic evidence
        OR->>RCA: re-evaluate hypothesis with new evidence
    end

    Note over OR,DOC: Step 4 - resolution & documentation in parallel
    par Guide the repair
        OR->>COP: start repair guidance session
        TECH->>COP: "What is wrong with this machine?"
        COP-->>TECH: step-by-step guidance, each step cites manual (Gemini Live)
    and Draft the paperwork
        OR->>DOC: draft 8D, work order, SOP proposal
        DOC-->>OR: {documents: [8D, work_order, SOP_proposal]}
        OR->>FS: record documents
    end
    Note over TECH,COP: Live voice/camera stream is the only direct human channel
    TECH->>COP: repair done
    COP-->>OR: {repair_done: true, steps_taken: [...]}
    OR->>FS: record repair outcome, end session

    Note over OR,QI: Step 5 - close only when the product confirms
    OR->>QI: verify 50 consecutive good products
    QI-->>OR: {verified: true, good_streak: 50, rate: 0.004}
    OR->>FS: verification progress
    OR->>FS: {status: closed, pending_approval: shift_leader}
    OR->>LEAD: documents for approval
    LEAD->>OR: approve
    OR->>FS: {approved: true}

    Note over OR,LRN: Step 6 - continuous learning & impact
    OR->>LRN: learn from closed incident & compute impact
    LRN-->>OR: {impact: {scrap_avoided: 240, downtime_min: 45, kwh: 38, co2_kg: 25}, knowledge_entry}
    OR->>FS: record impact card
    OR->>OR: add entry to defect-cause-fix library
